, goals, reflections, saved quotes and reading history. Export first if you want to keep a copy. Reminder permissions stay unchanged.");Button(onClick={sheet="";restore.launch(arrayOf("application/json","text/plain","application/octet-stream"))}){Text("Choose backup to restore")}};else->{Kicker("VIGIL  /  2.0");Text("A private journal for staying clean from pornography and gooning. Every day you choose to pass is a day you keep. The clock measures time, not your worth.");Text("${all.size} offline readings · VIGIL original")}}}
